s","domainId":"listening","mapDomainId":"comprehension","level":2,"format":"choice","answerMode":"exact","prompt":"Why did Meena skip the watering?","passage":"The garden chart said to water on Mondays and Thursdays. Another rule said to skip watering after heavy rain. Rain poured all Thursday morning. Meena checked the chart and looked at the wet garden. She left the watering can under the sink. The rule was there to stop roots sitting in soaked soil. Monday had been dry, so watering had gone ahead then. Thursday''s rain was heavy enough to fill the shallow dishes outside. The chart stayed on the wall; its usual days had not changed.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"Meena could not find the watering can","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/meena-could-not-find-the-watering-can-af3c7e1f59.mp3"},{"id":"c1","label":"rain had already watered the garden","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/rain-had-already-watered-the-garden-9441b1545e.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"Thursday was a day without watering","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/thursday-was-a-day-without-watering-09468053e4.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"plant food had replaced the watering","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/plant-food-had-replaced-the-watering-11b1e73723.mp3"}],"answer":"c1","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"listening","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"passage","text":"The garden chart said to water on Mondays and Thursdays. Another rule said to skip watering after heavy rain. Rain poured all Thursday morning. Meena checked the chart and looked at the wet garden. She left the watering can under the sink. The rule was there to stop roots sitting in soaked soil. Monday had been dry, so watering had gone ahead then. Thursday''s rain was heavy enough to fill the shallow dishes outside. The chart stayed on the wall; its usual