ady. Next, she tested a spoonful on that plate. The small sample held its shape instead of running. Only after that test did she fill the clean jars. Runny jam would have needed more cooking before this final step.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"boiled fruit with sugar"},{"id":"c1","label":"filled the clean jars"},{"id":"c2","label":"tested a small spoonful"},{"id":"c3","label":"washed the dusty fruit"}],"answer":"c2","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"reading","displayPassageDuringResponse":true,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"instruction","text":"What happened immediately before Hana filled the jars?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/what-happened-immediately-before-hana-filled-the-jars-b108a7c47f.mp3"}],"requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/what-happened-immediately-before-hana-filled-the-jars-b108a7c47f.mp3"],"stimulusKey":"the berries were ready for jam, but still dusty. first, hana washed them in a bowl of clean water. only the fruit belonged in the cooking pot. she then boiled the berries with sugar until thick. a cold plate would show whether the mixture was ready. next, she tested a spoonful on that plate. the small sample held its shape instead of running. only after that test did she fill the clean jars. runny jam would have needed more cooking before this final step.","constructClaim":"before_after_relation","sourceItemId":"lp3.sequencing.l2.A.before_after_relation.v1","sourceFormat":"COMPREHENSION","sourceProvenance":{"generatedBy":"assessment-rebuild-gate","sourceFile":"tools/assessmentRebuild/authoring/sequencing.mjs","wave":"","standardVersion":"v3"},"mediaDecision":{"itemId":"lp3.sequencing.l2.A.before_after_relation.v1","role":"text-only","paths":[],"constructReview":"approved","answerNeutral":"approved-empty-setting"},"distractorRationales":{"washed the dusty fruit":"D-SEQUENCE-SWAP","boiled fruit with sugar":"D-SEQU