ainId":"reading","mapDomainId":"comprehension","level":2,"format":"choice","answerMode":"exact","prompt":"What happened directly before Otto was offered the lollipop?","passage":"Otto was small enough for the barber''s special high chair. First, the barber fastened a gown around his shoulders. Its smooth cloth would keep loose hair off his shirt. Then the barber cut Otto''s hair with scissors. The hand mirror beside the chair could show the back. After the haircut, the barber held up that mirror. Otto could see the short, even shape all around. Last, the barber offered him a wrapped lollipop. The treat was for after the check, not during cutting.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"the barber showed the finished haircut"},{"id":"c1","label":"the barber covered Otto’s shirt"},{"id":"c2","label":"the barber shortened Otto’s hair"},{"id":"c3","label":"the barber offered Otto a sweet"}],"answer":"c0","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"reading","displayPassageDuringResponse":true,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"instruction","text":"What happened directly before Otto was offered the lollipop?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/what-happened-directly-before-otto-was-offered-the-lollipop-9469b6f750.mp3"}],"requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/what-happened-directly-before-otto-was-offered-the-lollipop-9469b6f750.mp3"],"stimulusKey":"otto was small enough for the barber''s special high chair. first, the barber fastened a gown around his shoulders. its smooth cloth would keep loose hair off his shirt. then the barber cut otto''s hair with scissors. the hand mirror beside the chair could show the back. after the haircut, the barber held up that mirror. otto could see the short, even shape all around. last, the barber offered him a wrapped lollipop. the treat was for after the check, not during cutting.","constructClaim":"before_after_relation","sourceI