y":"the lettuce seeds began life in a tray indoors. maya sowed them there during the cold weeks of march. a warm windowsill protected them from frost outside. in april, she moved the young plants into the garden. the nights were mild enough for outdoor growing by then. after the move, she watered the growing lettuces throughout may. their roots needed moisture while the leaves became bigger. in june, she cut the leafy heads for lunch. her calendar showed one main stage in each month.","constructClaim":"before_after_relation","sourceItemId":"lp3.sequencing.l2.B.before_after_relation.v5","sourceFormat":"COMPREHENSION","sourceProvenance":{"generatedBy":"assessment-rebuild-gate","sourceFile":"tools/assessmentRebuild/authoring/sequencing.mjs","wave":"","standardVersion":"v3"},"mediaDecision":{"itemId":"lp3.sequencing.l2.B.before_after_relation.v5","role":"text-only","paths":[],"constructReview":"approved","answerNeutral":"approved-empty-setting"},"distractorRationales":{"their leaves were cut for lunch":"D-SEQUENCE-SWAP","the young plants moved into the garden":"D-SEQUENCE-SWAP","their seeds went into an indoor tray":"D-SEQUENCE-SWAP"},"requiredImagePaths":[],"mediaReady":true}},{"id":"lp3.sequencing.l2.C.before_after_relation.v6","skillId":"sequencing","domainId":"reading","level":2,"format":"choice","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"the referee started the match"},{"id":"c1","label":"Euan checked where he would play"},{"id":"c2","label":"Euan cleaned his muddy boots"},{"id":"c3","label":"the team began its warm-up"}],"answer":"c1","answerMode":"exact","requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/which-event-came-directly-before-the-team-began-warming-up-dfa1dd5f31.mp3"],"itemSnapshot":{"id":"lp3.sequencing.l2.C.before_after_relation.v6","contentVersion":"literacy-mock-v1","skillId":"sequencing","domainId":"reading","mapDomainId":"comprehension","level":2,"format":"choice","answerMode":"exact","prompt":"Which event came directly before the team began warming up?","passage":"Euan''s boots were muddy before his football match. The evening before it, he cleaned the mud away. Clean studs would grip the field better than clogged ones. At noon on match day, he checked the team list. His name was beside the left-wing position. At one, the whole team began its warm-up together. That exercise prepared their muscles for running across the field. At two, the referee blew the starting whistle. Euan''s schedule put preparation before play across two separate days.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"the referee started the match"},{"id":"c1","label":"Euan checked where he would play"},{"id":"c2","label":"Euan cleaned his muddy boots"},{"id":"c3","label":"the team began its warm-up"}],"answer":"c1","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"reading","displayPassageDuringResponse":true,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"instruction","text":"Which event came directly before the team began warming up?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/which-event-came-directly-before-the-team-began-warming-up-dfa1dd5f31.mp3"}],"requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/which-event-came-directly-before-the-team-began-warming-up-dfa1dd5f31.mp3"],"stimulusKey":"euan''s boots were muddy before his football match. the evening before it, he cleaned the mud away. clean studs would grip the field better than clogged ones. at noon on match day, he checked the team list. his name was beside the left-wing position. at one, the whole team began its warm-up together. that exercise prepared their muscles for running across the field. at two, the referee blew the starting whistle. euan''s schedule put preparation before play across two separate days.","constructClaim":"before_after_relation","sourceItemId":"lp3.sequencing.l2.C.before_after_relation.v6","sourceFormat":"COMPREHENSION","sourceProvenance":{"generatedBy":"assessment-rebuild-gate","sourceFil