audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/what-comes-immediately-after-the-crew-dresses-for-the-rescue-7e629e5a3f.mp3"],"itemSnapshot":{"id":"lp3.sequencing.l2.C.process_order.v6","contentVersion":"literacy-mock-v1","skillId":"sequencing","domainId":"reading","mapDomainId":"comprehension","level":2,"format":"choice","answerMode":"exact","prompt":"What comes immediately after the crew dresses for the rescue?","passage":"The rescue station has four main actions after an emergency call. First, the alarm sounds to summon the waiting crew. The crew then puts on waterproof suits and safety equipment. Those clothes protect them during work on cold, rough water. Next, they launch the rescue boat from its covered slipway. Only once afloat do they follow directions towards the reported location. The caller''s position guides this final journey. Dressing belongs before launch because the crew must be protected already. The training chart keeps these four actions in order.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"the boat heads towards the reported location"},{"id":"c1","label":"the rescue boat enters the water"},{"id":"c2","label":"the station alarm calls the crew"},{"id":"c3","label":"the crew puts on its protective clothes"}],"answer":"c1","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"reading","displayPassageDuringResponse":true,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"instruction","text":"What comes immediately after the crew dresses for the rescue?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/what-comes-immediately-after-the-crew-dresses-for-the-rescue-7e629e5a3f.mp3"}],"requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/what-comes-immediately-after-the-crew-dresses-for-the-rescue-7e629e5a3f.mp3"],"stimulusKey":"the rescue station has four main actions after an emergency call. first, the alarm sounds to summon the waiting crew. the crew then puts on waterproof suits and safety equipment. those clo