 their sleeping bags inside"}],"answer":"c2","answerMode":"exact","requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/which-event-must-have-happened-before-the-class-arrived-ff1b62c5db.mp3"],"itemSnapshot":{"id":"lp3.sequencing.l2.C.implied_order.v48","contentVersion":"literacy-mock-v1","skillId":"sequencing","domainId":"reading","mapDomainId":"comprehension","level":2,"format":"choice","answerMode":"exact","prompt":"Which event must have happened before the class arrived?","passage":"When the class reached the campsite, their tents were already standing. The older pupils had arrived early to put them up. Sleeping bags still lay rolled beside the entrance to each tent. After choosing places, the children unrolled their bags inside. Soon the cook rang a bell beside the outdoor shelter. Everyone left their bags and carried a bowl to supper. By the time the stars appeared, the bowls were washed. A lantern glowed inside every tent before bedtime that night.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"the cook served supper to the whole class"},{"id":"c1","label":"the children washed their bowls after the meal"},{"id":"c2","label":"the older pupils built the tent shelters"},{"id":"c3","label":"the children placed their sleeping bags inside"}],"answer":"c2","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"reading","displayPassageDuringResponse":true,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"instruction","text":"Which event must have happened before the class arrived?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/which-event-must-have-happened-before-the-class-arrived-ff1b62c5db.mp3"}],"requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/which-event-must-have-happened-before-the-class-arrived-ff1b62c5db.mp3"],"stimulusKey":"when the class reached the campsite, their tents were already standing. the older pupils had arrived early to put them up. sleeping bags still lay rolled beside the entran