r the water to retrieve the shoe.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"the lifeguard lifted the shoe out","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/the-lifeguard-lifted-the-shoe-out-07a7028dd2.mp3"},{"id":"c1","label":"he called to the lifeguard for help","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/he-called-to-the-lifeguard-for-help-724eff466b.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"his shoe fell from the pier","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/his-shoe-fell-from-the-pier-81e0fbae80.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"the lifeguard fetched her long pole","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/the-lifeguard-fetched-her-long-pole-fff84ceef4.mp3"}],"answer":"c2","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"listening","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"passage","text":"Rio''s shoe was safe on the pier after the rescue. The lifeguard had lifted it from the water with a pole. Before lifting it, she had fetched that pole from her hut. Rio''s call for help had sent her to the hut. He had called because his shoe had fallen into the water. The pole was long enough to reach below the pier. Rio stayed well back from the edge throughout the rescue. No one needed to enter the water to retrieve the shoe.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/rio-s-shoe-was-safe-on-the-pier-after-the-rescue-the-lifeguard-had-lifted--1d4ef31ede.mp3"},{"role":"instruction","text":"What happened immediately before Rio called for help?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/what-happened-immediately-before-rio-called-for-help-d566c9869d.mp3"},{"role":"choice","text":"the lifeguard lifted the shoe out","value":"the lifeguard lifted the shoe out","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/the-lifeguard-lifted-the-shoe-out-07a7028dd2.mp3","choiceId":"c0"},{"role":"choice","text":"he called to the lifeguard for help","value":"he called to the lifeguar