 immediately before closing the box?","passage":"The parcel for Aunt Mara already had an address on top. Ffion had written it after closing the box with tape. Before taping it, she had packed three wrapped jam jars inside. Earlier still, she had filled those jars with homemade jam. Paper around the jars kept their glass sides apart. The closed box left no room for another jar inside. The address belonged on the outside, where the post office could see. Each of these four jobs depended on the previous one being finished.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"filled the jars with homemade jam","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/filled-the-jars-with-homemade-jam-c5f4414e06.mp3"},{"id":"c1","label":"closed the lid using strong tape","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/closed-the-lid-using-strong-tape-4558d4262a.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"wrote Aunt Mara’s address on top","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/wrote-aunt-mara-s-address-on-top-53f8739d79.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"packed the wrapped jars inside it","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/packed-the-wrapped-jars-inside-it-15d7cf35e0.mp3"}],"answer":"c3","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"listening","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"passage","text":"The parcel for Aunt Mara already had an address on top. Ffion had written it after closing the box with tape. Before taping it, she had packed three wrapped jam jars inside. Earlier still, she had filled those jars with homemade jam. Paper around the jars kept their glass sides apart. The closed box left no room for another jar inside. The address belonged on the outside, where the post office could see. Each of these four jobs depended on the previous one being finished.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/the-parcel-for-aunt-mara-already-had-an-address-on-top-ffion-had-written-i