y-mock-v1","skillId":"listen_sequencing","domainId":"listening","mapDomainId":"comprehension","level":2,"format":"choice","answerMode":"exact","prompt":"What happened directly before Bo glued the photos down?","passage":"The finished class poster hung beside the library door. Its photos had been glued down before it could hang there. Before gluing, Bo had arranged those pictures on the painted background. That background had dried before any photos touched it. Wet paint could have stuck to the pictures in unwanted places. Dry paint let Bo compare different spaces without a mess. The glue made the final arrangement stay in place. The last stage required photos that would stay attached when upright.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"the painted background became dry","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/the-painted-background-became-dry-af98a44fea.mp3"},{"id":"c1","label":"he hung the finished poster by the door","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/he-hung-the-finished-poster-by-the-door-373ac08c72.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"he fastened the photos with glue","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/he-fastened-the-photos-with-glue-8d7c4777c4.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"he arranged them on the dry background","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/he-arranged-them-on-the-dry-background-2e570d9de3.mp3"}],"answer":"c3","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"listening","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"passage","text":"The finished class poster hung beside the library door. Its photos had been glued down before it could hang there. Before gluing, Bo had arranged those pictures on the painted background. That background had dried before any photos touched it. Wet paint could have stuck to the pictures in unwanted places. Dry paint let Bo compare different spaces without a mess. The glue made the final arrangement stay in place. The last stage required photos that would stay attached when upright.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/the-finished-class-poster-hung-beside-the-library-door-its-photos-had-been-514c4a8055.mp3"},{"role":"instruction","text":"What happened directly before Bo glued the photos down?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/what-happened-directly-before-bo-glued-the-photos-down-38328e5db9.mp3"},{"role":"choice","text":"the painted background became dry","value":"the painted background became dry","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/the-painted-background-became-dry-af98a44fea.mp3","choiceId":"c0"},{"role":"choice","text":"he hung the finished poster by the door","value":"he hung the finished poster by the door","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/he-hung-the-finished-poster-by-the-door-373ac08c72.mp3","choiceId":"c1"},{"role":"choice","text":"he fastened the photos with glue","value":"he fastened the photos with glue","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/he-fastened-the-photos-with-glue-8d7c4777c4.mp3","choiceId":"c2"},{"role":"choice","text":"he arranged them on the dry background","value":"he arranged them on the dry background","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/he-arranged-them-on-the-dry-background-2e570d9de3.mp3","choiceId":"c3"}],"requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/the-finished-class-poster-hung-beside-the-library-door-its-photos-had-been-514c4a8055.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/what-happened-directly-before-bo-glued-the-photos-down-38328e5db9.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/the-painted-background-became-dry-af98a44fea.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/he-hung-the-finished-poster-by-the-door-373ac08c72.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/he-fastened-the-photos-with-glue-8d7c4777c4.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/he-arranged-them-on-the-dry-background-2e570d9de3.mp3"],"stimulusKey":"the finished class poster hung beside the library door. its photos had been glued down before it could hang there. before gluing, bo had arranged those pictures on the painted background. that background had dried before any photos touched it. wet paint could have stuck to the pictures in unwanted places. dry paint let bo compare different spaces without a mess. the glue made the final arrangement stay in place. the last stage required photos that would stay attached when upright.","constructClaim":"listening_implied_order","sourceItemId":"lp3.sequencing.l2.A.implied_order.v21","sourceFormat":"COMPREHENSION","sourceProvenance":{"generatedBy":"assessment-rebuild-gate","sourceFile":"tools/assessmentRebuild/authoring/sequencing.mjs","wave":"","standardVersion":"v3"},"mediaDecision":{"itemId":"lp3.sequencing.l2.A.implied_order.v21","role":"text-only","paths":[],"constructReview":"approved","answerNeutral":"approved"},"distractorRationales":{"he fastened the photos with glue":"D-SEQUENCE-SWAP","the painted background became dry":"D-SEQUENCE-SWAP","he hung the finished poster by the door":"D-SEQUENCE-SWAP"},"requiredImagePaths":[],"mediaReady":true}},{"id":"listen:lp3.sequencing.l2.A.process_order.v21","skillId":"listen_sequencing","domainId":"listening","level":2,"format":"choice","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"places it upright on the table","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/places-it-upright-on-the-table-fc92cf7404.mp3"},{"id":"c1","label":"waits while the grains settle down","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/waits-while-the-grains-settle-down-4ecb65598e.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"records the clear layer above the sand","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/records-the-clear-layer-above-the-sand-a511edc09f.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"shakes the sealed bottle until cloudy","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/shakes-the-sealed-bottle-until-cloudy-d264f67fb8.mp3"}],"answer":"c0","answerMode":"exact","requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/this-classroom-bottle-already-contains-water-and-a-little-sand-its-lid-is--674852c67f.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/what-does-tessa-do-immediately-after-shaking-the-bottle-a92a6ab3ac.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/places-it-upright-on-the-table-fc92cf7404.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/waits-while-the-grains-settle-down-4ecb65598e.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/records-the-clear-layer-above-the-sand-a511edc09f.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/shakes-the-sealed-bottle-until-cloudy-d264f67fb8.mp3"],"itemSnapshot":{"id":"listen:lp3.sequencing.l2.A.process_order.v21","contentVersion":"literacy-mock-v1","skillId":"listen_sequencing","domainId":"listening","mapDomainId":"comprehension","level":2,"format":"choice","answerMode":"exact","prompt":"What does Tessa do immediately after shaking the bottle?","passage":"This classroom bottle already contains water and a little sand. Its lid is tight enough to prevent any leaks. First, Tessa shakes the sealed bottle until the water looks cloudy. Next, she sets it upright on the table. During the third stage, the grains settle towards the bottom. Gravity pulls the heavier sand out of the cloudy mixture. Finally, Tessa records the clear water above the settled layer. The still bottle makes that layer easier to observe. Her recording belongs after settling, not while the grains are moving.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"places it upright on the table","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/places-it-upright-on-the-table-fc92cf7404.mp3"},{"id":"c1","label":"waits while the grains settle down","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/waits-while-the-grains-settle-down-4ecb65598e.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"records the clear layer above the sand","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/records-the-clear-layer-above-the-sand-a511edc09f.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"shakes the sealed bottle until cloudy","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/shakes-the-sealed-bottle-until-cloudy-d264f67fb8.mp3"}],"answer":"c0","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"listening","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"passage","text":"This classroom bottle already contains water and a little sand. Its lid is tight enough to prevent any leaks. First, Tessa shakes the sealed bottle until the water looks cloudy. Next, she sets it upright on the table. During the third stage, the grains settle towards the bottom. Gravity pulls the heavier sand out of the cloudy mixture. Finally, Tessa records the clear water above the settled layer. The still bottle makes that layer easier to observe. Her recording belongs after settling, not while the grains are moving.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/this-classroom-bottle-already-contains-water-and-a-little-sand-its-lid-is--674852c67f.mp3"},{"role":"instruction","text":"What does Tessa do immediately after shaking the bottle?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/what-does-tessa-do-immediately-after-shaking-the-bottle-a92a6ab3ac.mp3"},{"role":"choice","text":"places it upright on the table","value":"places it upright on the table","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/places-it-upright-on-the-table-fc92cf7404.mp3","choiceId":"c0"},{"role":"choice","text":"waits while the grains settle down","value":"waits while the grains settle down","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/waits-while-the-grains-settle-down-4ecb65598e.mp3","choiceId":"c1"},{"role":"choice","text":"records the clear layer above the sand","value":"records the clear layer above the sand","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/records-the-clear-layer-above-the-sand-a511edc09f.mp3","choiceId":"c2"},{"role":"choice","text":"shakes the sealed bottle until cloudy","value":"shakes the sealed bottle until cloudy","p