ea","domainId":"reading","level":2,"format":"choice","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"Nadia moved the stones until hidden creatures had nowhere to stay."},{"id":"c1","label":"Nadia compared two pools to find which held more creatures."},{"id":"c2","label":"By watching quietly, Nadia discovered life she had first overlooked."},{"id":"c3","label":"Nadia sat beside a dry rock and drew pictures of creatures."}],"answer":"c2","answerMode":"exact","requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/supplemental/which-sentence-sums-up-the-whole-passage-best-6b881f6d5d.mp3"],"itemSnapshot":{"id":"lp3.main_idea.l2.A.summary_choice.v4","contentVersion":"literacy-mock-v1","skillId":"main_idea","domainId":"reading","mapDomainId":"comprehension","level":2,"format":"choice","answerMode":"exact","prompt":"Which sentence sums up the whole passage best?","passage":"Nadia thought the tide pool was empty when she first arrived. Her moving shadow passed over the shallow water as she leaned. A guide asked her to sit still beside one dry rock. After a while, a tiny crab came out from hiding. Small arms opened on a sea creature fixed to a stone. Nadia noticed movement she had missed during her quick first look. She left every creature where it was and drew pictures. Her picture now showed creatures around the once empty-looking rock.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"Nadia moved the stones until hidden creatures had nowhere to stay."},{"id":"c1","label":"Nadia compared two pools to find which held more creatures."},{"id":"c2","label":"By watching quietly, Nadia discovered life she had first overlooked."},{"id":"c3","label":"Nadia sat beside a dry rock and drew pictures of creatures."}],"answer":"c2","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"reading","displayPassageDuringResponse":true,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"instruction","text":"Which sentence sums up the whole passage best?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/su