ily. At bedtime, his trumpet was back in its case.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"Amir and Dad compared the sound outside a softly furnished room."},{"id":"c1","label":"Amir stopped playing because every room made the trumpet equally loud."},{"id":"c2","label":"Amir chose the garden as the quietest place for trumpet practice."},{"id":"c3","label":"Amir tested places and adjusted his practice to disturb others less."}],"answer":"c3","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"reading","displayPassageDuringResponse":true,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"instruction","text":"Which sentence sums up the whole passage best?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/supplemental/which-sentence-sums-up-the-whole-passage-best-6b881f6d5d.mp3"}],"requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/supplemental/which-sentence-sums-up-the-whole-passage-best-6b881f6d5d.mp3"],"stimulusKey":"amir''s trumpet practice disturbed his sleeping baby sister. he tried the yard, but neighbours could still hear every note. the bathroom had an echo that made the sound louder. dad helped him test another room with thick curtains and rugs. outside that room, the family could hear much less noise. amir agreed to practise there before his sister''s bedtime. he kept learning while people nearby could rest more easily. at bedtime, his trumpet was back in its case.","constructClaim":"summary_choice","sourceItemId":"lp3.main_idea.l2.A.summary_choice.v7","sourceFormat":"COMPREHENSION","sourceProvenance":{"generatedBy":"assessment-rebuild-gate","sourceFile":"tools/assessmentRebuild/authoring/main_idea.mjs","wave":"","standardVersion":"v3"},"mediaDecision":{"itemId":"lp3.main_idea.l2.A.summary_choice.v7","role":"text-only","paths":[],"constructReview":"approved","answerNeutral":"approved-empty-setting"},"distractorRationales":{"Amir chose the garden as the quietest place for trumpet practice.":"D-OPPOSITE","Amir and Dad compared the sound o