la recognised a paint smell as soon as she came home. The hallway walls were still yellow, without any fresh patches. On the balcony, her old red bicycle stood on spread newspapers. Its bent bell and worn saddle were exactly as before. The frame was silver now, and wet drops marked the paper. Mom had matching spots on her hands beside an open tin. A clean brush rested across the top of that tin. Ela waited before touching the bicycle or rolling it indoors.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"Painting fresh silver patches on the hallway walls.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/painting-fresh-silver-patches-on-the-hallway-walls-369d99da42.mp3"},{"id":"c1","label":"Removing silver paint so the bicycle could stay red.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/removing-silver-paint-so-the-bicycle-could-stay-red-e6fe7dc40e.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"Putting a new coat of paint on Ela’s old bicycle.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/putting-a-new-coat-of-paint-on-ela-s-old-bicycle-09b0e0d8c3.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"Buying a different bicycle with a similar saddle.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/buying-a-different-bicycle-with-a-similar-saddle-47881b6ff0.mp3"}],"answer":"c2","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"listening","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"passage","text":"Ela recognised a paint smell as soon as she came home. The hallway walls were still yellow, without any fresh patches. On the balcony, her old red bicycle stood on spread newspapers. Its bent bell and worn saddle were exactly as before. The frame was silver now, and wet drops marked the paper. Mom had matching spots on her hands beside an open tin. A clean brush rested across the top of that tin. Ela waited before touching the bicycle or rolling it indoors.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/ela-recognised-a