 at the new time?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/why-did-few-families-arrive-at-the-new-time-ec01480e90.mp3"}],"requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/why-did-few-families-arrive-at-the-new-time-ec01480e90.mp3"],"stimulusKey":"the printer ran out of paper, so the notices were delayed. without notices, families did not know the new meeting time. only a few arrived when the meeting began. the meeting had moved from afternoon to morning that week. the school usually sent paper messages home before any change. staff had prepared them, but the empty tray stopped printing. families were still following the old time on their calendars. a few already knew because they had spoken to staff.","constructClaim":"chain","sourceItemId":"lp3.cause_effect.l2.A.chain.v21","sourceFormat":"COMPREHENSION","sourceProvenance":{"generatedBy":"assessment-rebuild-gate","sourceFile":"tools/assessmentRebuild/authoring/cause_effect.mjs","wave":"","standardVersion":"v3"},"mediaDecision":{"itemId":"lp3.cause_effect.l2.A.chain.v21","role":"text-only","paths":[],"constructReview":"approved","answerNeutral":"approved"},"distractorRationales":{"the printer had sent them the new time early":"D-OPPOSITE","the meeting had already finished before anyone knew":"D-PLAUSIBLE-UNSUPPORTED","the families had voted to cancel the meeting":"D-PLAUSIBLE-UNSUPPORTED"},"requiredImagePaths":[],"mediaReady":true}},{"id":"lp3.cause_effect.l2.A.multiple_causes.v21","skillId":"cause_effect","domainId":"reading","level":2,"format":"choice","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"heavy rain slowed their walking speed"},{"id":"c1","label":"both the fallen tree and the rain"},{"id":"c2","label":"the walkers followed an incorrect map"},{"id":"c3","label":"the fallen tree blocked their usual path"}],"answer":"c2","answerMode":"exact","requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/which-cause-of-lateness-is-not-supported-1c416e2135.mp3"],"itemSnapshot":{"id":"lp3.cause_effec