us broke down"},{"id":"c1","label":"the stops had been moved away from the route"},{"id":"c2","label":"more empty buses had arrived at the same time"},{"id":"c3","label":"fewer working buses had made that bus too full"}],"answer":"c3","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"reading","displayPassageDuringResponse":true,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"instruction","text":"Why could some passengers not board the next bus?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/why-could-some-passengers-not-board-the-next-bus-0c6ddc93c9.mp3"}],"requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/why-could-some-passengers-not-board-the-next-bus-0c6ddc93c9.mp3"],"stimulusKey":"a bus broke down, leaving fewer buses on the route. more people waited at each stop. the next bus filled up and could not take everyone. usually, two services shared the passengers during that busy hour. with one missing, everyone depended on the remaining service. every seat and safe standing space was already taken. the driver followed the limit for that vehicle. the people left at the stop had to wait for more space.","constructClaim":"chain","sourceItemId":"lp3.cause_effect.l2.A.chain.v22","sourceFormat":"COMPREHENSION","sourceProvenance":{"generatedBy":"assessment-rebuild-gate","sourceFile":"tools/assessmentRebuild/authoring/cause_effect.mjs","wave":"","standardVersion":"v3"},"mediaDecision":{"itemId":"lp3.cause_effect.l2.A.chain.v22","role":"text-only","paths":[],"constructReview":"approved","answerNeutral":"approved"},"distractorRationales":{"the passengers had arrived before any bus broke down":"D-PLAUSIBLE-UNSUPPORTED","the stops had been moved away from the route":"D-PLAUSIBLE-UNSUPPORTED","more empty buses had arrived at the same time":"D-OPPOSITE"},"requiredImagePaths":[],"mediaReady":true}},{"id":"lp3.cause_effect.l2.A.reversal_trap.v21","skillId":"cause_effect","domainId":"reading","level":2,"form