wing water reach the ceiling below?","passage":"Dee left the bath tap running to answer her phone. Water rose over the bath''s edge during the long call. It ran through a gap beside the pipe. The water then made a mark on the ceiling below. Dee saw the mark after ending the call. The ceiling mark was directly beneath that part of the bathroom. No pipe had burst inside the wall. A dry towel covered the floor on the other side. The open space around the pipe gave the spilled water a route.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"Dee left the room to answer her phone","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/dee-left-the-room-to-answer-her-phone-0bdc5af10d.mp3"},{"id":"c1","label":"Dee ending her long phone call","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/dee-ending-her-long-phone-call-e118e887c4.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"water rose to the edge of the bath","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/water-rose-to-the-edge-of-the-bath-a59cef8709.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"water ran through the gap by the pipe","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/water-ran-through-the-gap-by-the-pipe-2de038c4dd.mp3"}],"answer":"c3","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"listening","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"passage","text":"Dee left the bath tap running to answer her phone. Water rose over the bath''s edge during the long call. It ran through a gap beside the pipe. The water then made a mark on the ceiling below. Dee saw the mark after ending the call. The ceiling mark was directly beneath that part of the bathroom. No pipe had burst inside the wall. A dry towel covered the floor on the other side. The open space around the pipe gave the spilled water a route.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/dee-left-the-bath-tap-running-to-answer-her-phone-water-rose-over-the-bath-53c37f51cf.mp3"},{"role":"instruction","text":"W