exact","prompt":"Which cause of the break is NOT mentioned?","passage":"The old swing rope was worn after years of weather. Its knot rubbed against a rough branch on every swing. On Sunday, two children sat on the seat together. The worn rope broke under their weight. The rubbing point was thinner than the rest of the rope. A single rider usually placed less strain on that weak spot. This time the extra weight pulled on the damaged fibres together. An adult removed the broken swing so nobody else could use it.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"someone had cut part of the rope","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/someone-had-cut-part-of-the-rope-fc0089b521.mp3"},{"id":"c1","label":"rain and sun had worn the rope","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/rain-and-sun-had-worn-the-rope-eda9f5ace7.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"the knot had rubbed against the branch","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/the-knot-had-rubbed-against-the-branch-41e13637ef.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"two riders had added weight together","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/two-riders-had-added-weight-together-661e2a70c0.mp3"}],"answer":"c0","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"listening","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"passage","text":"The old swing rope was worn after years of weather. Its knot rubbed against a rough branch on every swing. On Sunday, two children sat on the seat together. The worn rope broke under their weight. The rubbing point was thinner than the rest of the rope. A single rider usually placed less strain on that weak spot. This time the extra weight pulled on the damaged fibres together. An adult removed the broken swing so nobody else could use it.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/the-old-swing-rope-was-worn-after-years-of-weather-its-knot-rubbed-against-2b48c853cd.mp3"},{"role":"inst