antly warm after its heater started. The small office next door remained frigid throughout the morning. Inside, the principal kept her coat buttoned beneath a thick blanket. Even after rubbing her hands, her fingers felt painfully cold. She moved her work into the hall while waiting for repairs. Both rooms had been quiet before the children arrived. The difference was not their noise or how neatly papers were arranged. Warm air finally reached the office when its heater was fixed.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"Extremely cold and uncomfortable.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/extremely-cold-and-uncomfortable-9d9732a8c0.mp3"},{"id":"c1","label":"Warm enough to feel comfortable.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/warm-enough-to-feel-comfortable-0c511e4056.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"Unusually quiet without any voices.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/unusually-quiet-without-any-voices-d0c75c5633.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"Untidy with papers left everywhere.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/untidy-with-papers-left-everywhere-00ab040ea7.mp3"}],"answer":"c0","targetWord":"frigid","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"frigid","modality":"recognition","displayPassageDuringResponse":true,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"instruction","text":"In this passage, what does \"frigid\" mean?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/in-this-passage-what-does-frigid-mean-a7bc05a626.mp3"},{"role":"target_word","text":"frigid","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/frigid-59d9d88359.mp3"},{"role":"choice","text":"Extremely cold and uncomfortable.","value":"Extremely cold and uncomfortable.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/extremely-cold-and-uncomfortable-9d9732a8c0.mp3","choiceId":"c0"},{"role":"choice","text":"Warm enough to feel comfortable.","value":"Warm enough to feel comfortable.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_wor