sage":"The little boat stayed tied beside the dock after its passengers left. A passing ferry sent gentle waves towards its wooden hull. The boat bobbed as each wave reached the place it floated. Its nose rose above the dock''s edge, then dropped below it. The next wave brought the same change in height again. Its rope kept it near the post throughout this movement. It did not travel down the harbour or turn in circles. When the water settled, the boat''s nose stayed level beside the dock.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"Travelled quickly away from the place it was tied.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/travelled-quickly-away-from-the-place-it-was-tied-ca053c9bda.mp3"},{"id":"c1","label":"Turned steadily in circles around the nearest post.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/turned-steadily-in-circles-around-the-nearest-post-52e2f35e84.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"Stayed at exactly the same height without moving.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/stayed-at-exactly-the-same-height-without-moving-2aeeba13d8.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"Moved up and down repeatedly on the water.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/moved-up-and-down-repeatedly-on-the-water-ecb1c06c2c.mp3"}],"answer":"c3","targetWord":"bobbed","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"bobbed","modality":"recognition","displayPassageDuringResponse":true,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"instruction","text":"In this passage, what does \"bobbed\" mean?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/supplemental/in-this-passage-what-does-bobbed-mean-75697b302e.mp3"},{"role":"target_word","text":"bobbed","path":"/audio/production/en-US/supplemental/bobbed-89b022d59c.mp3"},{"role":"choice","text":"Travelled quickly away from the place it was tied.","value":"Travelled quickly away from the place it was tied.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/travelled-quickly-away-from-the-place-it-was-tied-ca053c9bda.