":"Etta found a feathered young bird hopping beneath a thick hedge. She fetched a box, wanting to carry it into the house. A wildlife helper asked her to describe the bird before acting. The helper explained that its parent might still be feeding it. Etta put the box away and kept the cat indoors instead. She watched from a distance without standing beside the bird. Soon an adult bird arrived with food and flew away again. Etta left the youngster sheltered beneath the hedge as advised.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"Useful help begins with understanding what is actually needed."},{"id":"c1","label":"Preparing a safe place beforehand can prevent an emergency."},{"id":"c2","label":"Waiting without seeking information is enough to solve a problem."},{"id":"c3","label":"A kind intention makes checking your planned action unnecessary."}],"answer":"c0","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"reading","displayPassageDuringResponse":true,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"instruction","text":"Which lesson is best supported by the story?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/which-lesson-is-best-supported-by-the-story-65e6826fff.mp3"}],"requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/which-lesson-is-best-supported-by-the-story-65e6826fff.mp3"],"stimulusKey":"etta found a feathered young bird hopping beneath a thick hedge. she fetched a box, wanting to carry it into the house. a wildlife helper asked her to describe the bird before acting. the helper explained that its parent might still be feeding it. etta put the box away and kept the cat indoors instead. she watched from a distance without standing beside the bird. soon an adult bird arrived with food and flew away again. etta left the youngster sheltered beneath the hedge as advised.","constructClaim":"theme_among_rivals","sourceItemId":"lp3.theme_higher_comprehension.l2.B.theme_among_rivals.v5","sourceFormat":"CO