 contest turn had passed. She received no ribbon, though her untouched cake was still ready. She stayed beside Zeke as visitors enjoyed the desserts they shared.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"Protecting your own chance matters more than another person’s trouble."},{"id":"c1","label":"Helping someone can be worth giving up a personal reward."},{"id":"c2","label":"Learning from a design mistake can improve the next attempt."},{"id":"c3","label":"The finest-looking food is always the most enjoyable to share."}],"answer":"c1","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"reading","displayPassageDuringResponse":true,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"instruction","text":"Which lesson is best supported by the story?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/which-lesson-is-best-supported-by-the-story-65e6826fff.mp3"}],"requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/which-lesson-is-best-supported-by-the-story-65e6826fff.mp3"],"stimulusKey":"nell had finished decorating her cake before the contest opened. zeke arrived with his own cake, then dropped its box. the pieces were safe inside, but his careful design had collapsed. nell''s name was called while she helped him collect clean cups. they layered the cake pieces with fruit into small desserts. by the time they finished, nell''s contest turn had passed. she received no ribbon, though her untouched cake was still ready. she stayed beside zeke as visitors enjoyed the desserts they shared.","constructClaim":"theme_among_rivals","sourceItemId":"lp3.theme_higher_comprehension.l2.C.theme_among_rivals.v6","sourceFormat":"COMPREHENSION","sourceProvenance":{"generatedBy":"assessment-rebuild-gate","sourceFile":"tools/assessmentRebuild/authoring/theme_higher_comprehension.mjs","wave":"","standardVersion":"v3"},"mediaDecision":{"itemId":"lp3.theme_higher_comprehension.l2.C.theme_among_rivals.v6","role":"text-only","paths":[],"constr