 performance can make a strong impression too.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-soft-performance-can-make-a-strong-impression-too-87825f6058.mp3"}],"answer":"c3","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"listening","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"passage","text":"Yusuf thought his loud trumpet would be the concert''s most impressive sound. He told Amal that nobody would notice her quiet harp tune. Both children had practised carefully and could play their music well. During Amal''s piece, the audience stopped rustling and leaned forward. After the last gentle note, they stayed silent before applauding warmly. Yusuf''s cheerful piece received warm applause too. Afterwards, he asked Amal to show him her softest passage again. This time, he listened without trying to play over it.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/yusuf-thought-his-loud-trumpet-would-be-the-concert-s-most-impressive-soun-c6cc7ac7d6.mp3"},{"role":"instruction","text":"Which lesson is best supported by the story?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/which-lesson-is-best-supported-by-the-story-65e6826fff.mp3"},{"role":"choice","text":"Combining different skills can make a shared performance stronger.","value":"Combining different skills can make a shared performance stronger.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/combining-different-skills-can-make-a-shared-performance-stronger-f77addd6ae.mp3","choiceId":"c0"},{"role":"choice","text":"Playing the same instrument helps people understand each other better.","value":"Playing the same instrument helps people understand each other better.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/playing-the-same-instrument-helps-people-understand-each-other-better-a7ec563c64.mp3","choiceId":"c1"},{"role":"choice","text":"Being heard above everyone else is the best measure of success.","value":"