k storm. The keeper read the letter beside his neatly stored cleaning tools. He left the tools ready for the person taking his place.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"Trying a new routine can make a familiar job more exciting.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/trying-a-new-routine-can-make-a-familiar-job-more-exciting-a4d9dbd16e.mp3"},{"id":"c1","label":"The keeper cleaned the lighthouse glass throughout forty years of service.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/the-keeper-cleaned-the-lighthouse-glass-throughout-forty-years-of-service-82c3df9528.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"Useful work can matter deeply even when its worker is unseen.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/useful-work-can-matter-deeply-even-when-its-worker-is-unseen-e65ba86061.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"Teaching a skill is the best way to become widely famous.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/teaching-a-skill-is-the-best-way-to-become-widely-famous-4043587c97.mp3"}],"answer":"c2","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"listening","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"passage","text":"For forty years, the lighthouse keeper checked the lamp each night. He cleaned the glass even when nobody visited the little island. Most sailors saw the signal without ever learning his name. He sometimes wondered whether anyone noticed the hours spent maintaining it. At retirement, letters arrived from ships that had followed its light. One sailor described finding the harbour safely during a dark storm. The keeper read the letter beside his neatly stored cleaning tools. He left the tools ready for the person taking his place.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/for-forty-years-the-lighthouse-keeper-checked-the-lamp-each-night-he-clean-95ca12e05b.mp3"},{"role":"instruction","text":"Which message does the whole story support?","pa