-ddc8e7aa3a.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"Amaya’s small lantern stayed upright during the windy evening parade.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/amaya-s-small-lantern-stayed-upright-during-the-windy-evening-parade-87655c7384.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"A sound design can matter more than an impressive appearance.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-sound-design-can-matter-more-than-an-impressive-appearance-f257ec1dd9.mp3"}],"answer":"c3","answerMode":"exact","requiredAudioPaths":["/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/amaya-planned-a-lantern-for-the-windy-evening-parade-near-the-coast-she-us-a5e8e96548.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/which-message-does-the-whole-story-support-0b441f133f.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/making-matching-decorations-can-help-a-group-feel-united-1c5ec221cd.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/following-other-people-s-designs-can-save-useful-planning-time-ddc8e7aa3a.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/amaya-s-small-lantern-stayed-upright-during-the-windy-evening-parade-87655c7384.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-sound-design-can-matter-more-than-an-impressive-appearance-f257ec1dd9.mp3"],"itemSnapshot":{"id":"listen:lp3.theme_higher_comprehension.l2.B.theme_vs_plot.v5","contentVersion":"literacy-mock-v1","skillId":"listen_theme","domainId":"listening","mapDomainId":"comprehension","level":2,"format":"choice","answerMode":"exact","prompt":"Which message does the whole story support?","passage":"Amaya planned a lantern for the windy evening parade near the coast. She used a small frame with strong joins and thick covering. Friends chose taller shapes that looked grand beside her plain little lantern. Amaya checked her joins once more instead of adding extra height. Along the route, a gust tore the thin sides of several lanterns. Some large frames bent, and their owners carried them folded home. Amaya''s light stayed covered inside its firm frame throu