 to be questioned. Jules carried the new pot with both hands on the next visit.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"A rider lends a spare helmet to a friend who has forgotten one.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-rider-lends-a-spare-helmet-to-a-friend-who-has-forgotten-one-72eb685b89.mp3"},{"id":"c1","label":"A rider admits scratching a borrowed bicycle and helps arrange its repair.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-rider-admits-scratching-a-borrowed-bicycle-and-helps-arrange-its-repair-ac149f820a.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"A rider hides a damaged bicycle behind a shed before its owner returns.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-rider-hides-a-damaged-bicycle-behind-a-shed-before-its-owner-returns-d47ad50e6c.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"A rider practises balancing until a difficult corner becomes easy to turn.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-rider-practises-balancing-until-a-difficult-corner-becomes-easy-to-turn-12bf8a1088.mp3"}],"answer":"c1","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"listening","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"passage","text":"Jules borrowed a neighbour''s plant pot for a school display. While carrying it home, he caught its edge against the gate. A crack spread down the side, though it still stood upright. He first placed it where the damaged part faced the wall. Before returning it, he moved it back and told the neighbour. Jules offered his pocket money and helped choose a suitable replacement. The neighbour thanked him for explaining without waiting to be questioned. Jules carried the new pot with both hands on the next visit.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/jules-borrowed-a-neighbour-s-plant-pot-for-a-school-display-while-carrying-30d4ebf437.mp3"},{"role":"instruction","text":"Which new situation shows the SAME lesson?","path":"/audio/pro