 windy nights, she checked for small branches across the paving. She moved the light ones and told an adult about heavy ones. When the path was clear, she continued to school as usual. Most walkers arrived later and never saw who had checked it. Once, a neighbour noticed and offered to mention her in the newsletter. Evi accepted thanks but kept doing the checks on unmentioned days too. Pushchairs and walking sticks passed easily along the cleared route.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"A gardener chooses attractive tools so visitors will admire the tidy shed.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-gardener-chooses-attractive-tools-so-visitors-will-admire-the-tidy-shed-cfb1b9362a.mp3"},{"id":"c1","label":"A caretaker clears slippery steps early without needing public praise each time.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-caretaker-clears-slippery-steps-early-without-needing-public-praise-each-e1f4593537.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"A singer rehearses a difficult song to improve before a public concert.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-singer-rehearses-a-difficult-song-to-improve-before-a-public-concert-8504b78378.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"A shopper returns extra change after noticing the cashier made a mistake.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-shopper-returns-extra-change-after-noticing-the-cashier-made-a-mistake-0366bd90e9.mp3"}],"answer":"c1","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"listening","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"passage","text":"Evi walked along the village path before most neighbours left home. After windy nights, she checked for small branches across the paving. She moved the light ones and told an adult about heavy ones. When the path was clear, she continued to school as usual. Most walkers arrived later and never saw who had checked it. Once, a neighbour noticed