uation shows the SAME lesson?","passage":"Suri noticed an extra point beside her name during the final game. The scorer had counted one of her missed throws as a success. Nobody else appeared to have noticed the small error on the board. Correcting it would place another player just ahead of her. Suri waited for the pause, then explained which throw had missed. The scorer checked and changed the total before announcing the winner. Suri clapped with the others and collected her own score sheet. The mark beside that throw now matched what had really happened.","choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"A pupil helps a classmate practise so both understand the next lesson.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-pupil-helps-a-classmate-practise-so-both-understand-the-next-lesson-b9ca065c3c.mp3"},{"id":"c1","label":"A pupil chooses a harder task to learn something new after finishing.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-pupil-chooses-a-harder-task-to-learn-something-new-after-finishing-93679d3e20.mp3"},{"id":"c2","label":"A pupil corrects an extra mark even though it costs first place.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-pupil-corrects-an-extra-mark-even-though-it-costs-first-place-7d6885c9fe.mp3"},{"id":"c3","label":"A pupil asks for a missing mark to be added to improve her score.","audioPath":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-pupil-asks-for-a-missing-mark-to-be-added-to-improve-her-score-8549c658d8.mp3"}],"answer":"c2","targetWord":"","renderTargetText":false,"image":"","imageAlt":"","modality":"listening","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"tutorialOnly":false,"requiredAudioCues":[{"role":"passage","text":"Suri noticed an extra point beside her name during the final game. The scorer had counted one of her missed throws as a success. Nobody else appeared to have noticed the small error on the board. Correcting it would place another player just ahead of her. Suri waited for the pause, then expla