's group each received a different part of a treasure map. Hana kept her piece hidden because it showed the final landing place. Others could see safe paths but not where those paths should end. Their first route stopped at a river with no crossing nearby. Hana unfolded her piece when she saw that nobody could finish alone. Together, they joined the sections and found a bridge upstream. Each child explained a clue missing from the others'' pieces. The group reached the landing place using the map they had assembled.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/hana-s-group-each-received-a-different-part-of-a-treasure-map-hana-kept-he-9a5b934c5f.mp3"},{"role":"instruction","text":"Which new situation shows the same lesson?","path":"/audio/production/en-US/supplemental/which-new-situation-shows-the-same-lesson-6869cf72df.mp3"},{"role":"choice","text":"A helper returns an extra reward because it was awarded by mistake.","value":"A helper returns an extra reward because it was awarded by mistake.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-helper-returns-an-extra-reward-because-it-was-awarded-by-mistake-45e56d499c.mp3","choiceId":"c0"},{"role":"choice","text":"Team members share different information so they can solve a problem together.","value":"Team members share different information so they can solve a problem together.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/team-members-share-different-information-so-they-can-solve-a-problem-toget-60a5249772.mp3","choiceId":"c1"},{"role":"choice","text":"A player keeps a useful clue private to finish ahead of her teammates.","value":"A player keeps a useful clue private to finish ahead of her teammates.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/a-player-keeps-a-useful-clue-private-to-finish-ahead-of-her-teammates-35da131bd2.mp3","choiceId":"c2"},{"role":"choice","text":"A learner repeats a difficult skill alone until she can do it smoothly.","value":"A learner repeats a difficult skill alone until she can 